{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":442289,\"title\":\"Losers\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Pop culture addicts Zack and Manny attend an engagement party where groom-to-be Roy, a former uber-geek has turned 'normal' in an effort to pursue a happy future with beautiful vegan baker, Emily. Manny panics when he learns that at a vegan party there's no meat, eggs or dairy. He falls into a delirium leading to near-death where he meets his guardian angel, Serra. Zack is given some sage advice from ganja guru, Moses, and decided that he must save Roy from himself. In the end, Roy realized that it's best to let your 'geek' flag fly. Flash forward to the wedding day... zombies disrupt the festivities.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2014,\"runtime\":23,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":5000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Carlos del Rosario\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1760055,\"name\":\"Carlos del Rosario\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1523334,\"name\":\"Zack Abramowitz\",\"character\":\"Zachary Freeman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1760051,\"name\":\"Matt Steiner\",\"character\":\"Manny\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1760052,\"name\":\"Devin Klos\",\"character\":\"Roy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1760053,\"name\":\"Maya Murphy\",\"character\":\"Emily\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1760054,\"name\":\"Shannon Kendall\",\"character\":\"Serra the Angel\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1755391,\"name\":\"Chaka DeSilva\",\"character\":\"Moses\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e0RAQu3NYXvfHtNnVfpV3gMzMLx.jpg\"},{\"id\":206070,\"name\":\"Diana Cherkas\",\"character\":\"Margaux\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1523336,\"name\":\"Matthew Rappaport\",\"character\":\"Cupcake Extra\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":533535,\"title\":\"Deadpool & Wolverine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/by8z9Fe8y7p4jo2YlW2SZDnptyT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1327819,\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scientists have discovered how to 'hop' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":939243,\"title\":\"Sonic the Hedgehog 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d8Ryb8AunYAuycVKDp5HpdWPKgC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zOpe0eHsq0A2NvNyBbtT6sj53qV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sonic, Knuckles, and Tails reunite against a powerful new adversary, Shadow, a mysterious villain with powers unlike anything they have faced before. With their abilities outmatched in every way, Team Sonic must seek out an unlikely alliance in hopes of stopping Shadow and protecting the planet.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":519182,\"title\":\"Despicable Me 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wWba3TaojhK7NdycRhoQpsG0FaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/twsxsfao6ZOVvT8LfudH603MMi6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":284053,\"title\":\"Thor: Ragnarok\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vLmHH8jAy8Jq8uBsLucd3592WGh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":696506,\"title\":\"Mickey 17\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/edKpE9B5qN3e559OuMCLZdW1iBZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9PRKAdrDvAdCfg3EcApLTfzGsEt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Unlikely hero Mickey Barnes finds himself in the extraordinary circumstance of working for an employer who demands the ultimate commitment to the job… to die, for a living.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":792307,\"title\":\"Poor Things\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kCGlIMHnOm8JPXq3rXM6c5wMxcT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zh6IdheEYinU4TPtorWsjx6qPQE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Brought back to life by an unorthodox scientist, a young woman runs off with a lawyer on a whirlwind adventure across the continents. Free from the prejudices of her times, she grows steadfast in her purpose to stand for equality and liberation.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":552524,\"title\":\"Lilo & Stitch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ckQzKpQJO4ZQDCN5evdpKcfm7Ys.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Zx3wDG5bBtcfk8lcnCWDOLM4Y4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":701387,\"title\":\"Bugonia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rSdOua3wKMEaFWDcKAYWRjXQWOt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tN3pTxkQoP96wtaEahYuRVdUWb2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550988,\"title\":\"Free Guy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dxraF0qPr1OEgJk17ltQTO84kQF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOJb0yQOCny0bPjg8bCLw8DyAD7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A bank teller discovers he is actually a background player in an open-world video game, and decides to become the hero of his own story. Now, in a world where there are no limits, he is determined to be the guy who saves his world his way before it's too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1081328,\"title\":\"Atrapadas en familia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nMRcShUYbVuOi2MItjqfhnSEKF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fxHw5g2lJxSFrqxi10KahA5BVKl.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Caro and Sofía get ready for a weekend with their families and the surprise of a marriage proposal that could go very wrong.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":305145,\"title\":\"Samurai Chicks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j27LVsqSQKBEj3X5FXN96ekpk2i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On of the southernmost islands of Japan, there's a dance school 'Orion Dancers Academy'. Hiding its public identity as a training school of singers and dancers, it actually operates as a girl-warrior training school, in order to win independence of the island. The secretly trained agents watch the music video of charismatic idol Cocoe on a huge TV monitor, and unlock codes from her dancing to complete their missions. However, the dark shadow of a rival organization slowly sneaks up on the girls and the training school on the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"mdkHvXPEWpI\",\"name\":\"LOSERS Trailer: Revised\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}